---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import aboutPhoto from '../assets/about.png';
---

<section class="about" id="about">
  <Image src={aboutPhoto} alt="" class="about__bg" aria-hidden="true" width={2880} height={1440} />
  <div class="about__inner">
    <h2 class="about__heading">About</h2>
    <p class="about__body">
      The most transformative solutions do more than just improve how we do things — they change 
      what we thought was possible. My favorite moments as an engineer and community leader always
      stem from questioning the status quo to change even a small slice of our world.
    </p>

    <p class="about__body">
      I'm a software engineer by trade with <strong>6 years</strong> across startups and enterprise building
      <strong>cloud-native infrastructure</strong>, <strong>event-driven architecture</strong>, 
      and <strong>full-stack applications</strong>. I've adapted across many technical stacks while
      asking "what haven't we thought of yet and what will we be grateful for in the future?"
      I practiced what I preach with 
      <a href="https://www.findmyfgc.cc" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">FindMyFGC.cc</a> 
      — giving a grassroots community an easy way to help friends near and far find real events for
      our niche hobby, and I'm currently working on resources and projects to help both technical and
      non-technical builders get more out of AI.
    </p>

    <p class="about__body">
      Outside of work I mentor developers, organize competitive gaming events, and hop on the arcade
      sticks myself. I'm currently building, learning, and <strong>open to new opportunities</strong>.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    position: relative;
    padding: 6rem 2rem;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .about__bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center 60%;
    filter: brightness(0.35) saturate(0.5);
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .about__inner {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    max-width: 640px;
    width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    border-radius: 4px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
    padding: 1.5rem 2.5rem;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 48px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
  }

  .about__heading {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .about__body {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--color-text);
    opacity: 0.85;
  }

  .about__body a {
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
    text-decoration-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35);
  }

  .about__body a:hover {
    text-decoration-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
  }

  .about__body strong {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text);
    opacity: 1;
  }
</style>
